{title: Kiss Me}
{artist: Sixpence None the Richer}
{key: D}

{start_of_verse: Intro}
[D]  [Dmaj7]  [D7]  [Dmaj7]
[D]  [Dmaj7]  [D7]  [Dmaj7]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[D]Kiss me [Dmaj7]out of the bearded barley
[D7]Nightly, [Dmaj7]beside the green, green [D]grass
Swing, swing, [Dmaj7]swing the spinning step
[D7]You wear those shoes and I [G]will wear that dress
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Oh oh [Em]kiss me [A]beneath the [D]milky twi[Bm]light
[Em]Lead me [A]out on the [D]moonlit [D7]floor
[Em]Lift your open [A]hand
[D]Strike up the [D/C#]band and make the [Bm7]fireflies dance, [D/A]silver moon's
[Gmaj7]sparkling. [Asus4]So kiss [A]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Interlude}
[D]  [Dmaj7]  [D7]  [Dmaj7]  [N.C.]
me.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[D]Kiss me [Dmaj7]down by the broken tree [D7]house
Swing me [Dmaj7]upon its hanging [D]tire
Bring, bring, [Dmaj7]bring your flowered hat
[D7]We'll take the trail marked on your [G]father's map
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Oh oh [Em]kiss me [A]beneath the [D]milky twi[Bm]light
[Em]Lead me [A]out on the [D]moonlit [D7]floor
[Em]Lift your open [A]hand
[D]Strike up the [D/C#]band and make the [Bm7]fireflies dance, [D/A]silver moon's
[Gmaj7]sparkling. [Asus4]So kiss [A]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Solo}
{comment: Harmonica/Accordion}
[D]  [Dmaj7]  [D7]  [Dmaj7] me.
[D]  [Dmaj7]  [D7]  [Dmaj7]

{comment: Guitars}
[Em] [A] [D] [Bm]
[Em] [A] [D] [D7]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Em]Kiss me [A]beneath the [D]milky twi[Bm]light
[Em]Lead me [A]out on the [D]moonlit [D7]flo[Em]or
Lift your open [A]hand
[D]Strike up the [D/C#]band and make the [Bm7]fireflies dance, [D/A]silver moon's
